{
 "page": "GoinQuackersRecompiled.html",
 "header": [
  "The page's plan for N64Recomp-browser's tools/play_page.mjs, its extended play of about 5 minutes: the launcher, Load ROM",
  "on a new profile once the shader list Chrome builds behind it is done (Firefox builds none there and says so), Start",
  "Game, the logos and the title, then Start (Enter) to the main menu and A (Space) through New Game and the newscast",
  "to the world map (mapmonde), as a player does: the menus go by the level the game is in, tools/survey.js's level().",
  "Then the plan changes level as the game's own exits do (survey.js's go(), each a need that fails the run unless the",
  "game plays that level): the regular plan's trail (40 s, with the pause menu), sidewalk (30 s) and haunted_3_1",
  "(25 s), and then forest_chase, roof and city_chase for 20 s each and inca_4_1 for 25 s, the same way.",
  "Its waits and holds are on the game's own clock (survey.js's clock(), 60 a second of play).",
  "The menu shot is 3 s into the menu on that clock too, which stands still while Firefox builds the shader list's boot",
  "section as the menu first draws, the game waiting: 3 s of the browser's time there can shoot that wait's black."
 ],
